    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td><strong>0.2.0</strong></td>
        <td>Docs foundation</td>
        <td>✅ <code>docs/</code> static site built with Flint (shell from the
            m2-mock prototype), page template with copy-button snippets, docs
            pages for the five shipping components (bottom-nav, drawer, rail,
            auth, lists), SVG anatomy illustrations. Buttons and cards already
